  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to 178 Bluejack St! <br><br>This home was completely remodeled in 2024 and professionally designed and staged! <br><br>This beautifully renovated beach cottage in the highly sought-after Phase Three of WaterColor is your ideal vacation destination! Nestled on a spacious corner lot just steps from the serene frog pond pool and park, this gorgeous home offers the ultimate blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience. With five bedrooms and five bathrooms, including a fun bunk room, this spacious retreat comfortably accommodates large families or groups. The expansive 500+ square feet of screened porches are perfect for sipping morning coffee, playing board games, or enjoying evening cocktails in the coastal breeze. <br><br>**Important Information - Please Read**<br><br>- Max Occupancy: 12 guests (You must confirm the number of guests in your party at least 10 days before arrival in order to receive Watercolor Access Passes) <br>- Minimum Age to Book: 25 years (No Exceptions) <br>- Check-in & Check-out: Check-in at 4:30 PM CDT and check-out at 9:00 AM CDT <br>- Golf Cart: 6 Passenger golf cart included. <br>- Incidentals Hold: $1,500. The hold is released on the day of checkout. <br>- Mail & Package Delivery: Mail forwarding is in place. Do not ship packages to the home. We cannot guarantee delivery. <br>- Rental Agreement: Must be signed prior to arrival.<br>- Parking: 4 standard size vehicles (No overflow parking available) <br>- Community Access: Complimentary access to all WaterColor community swimming pools, including - Camp WaterColor and the Beach Club. Guests must confirm the number of people in their party and complete the resort waiver at least 10 days prior to arrival to guarantee access.<br>- Starter Pack: Includes 6 rolls of toilet paper, 2 rolls of paper towels, hotel-style soaps for each bathroom, kitchen sponge, dish soap, dish towels, and a laundry pod pack. Guests must purchase additional supplies. <br>- Private Beach Access: Guests have complimentary access to the Watercolor Beach Club. Chairs and umbrella rentals are available for an additional fee from the beach vendor. First come, first serve basis. <br>- WaterColor Trolley: Operates daily in season (April - Labor Day) from 9:30 AM - 5:30 PM, circulating to all WaterColor neighborhoods, community pools, and the Beach Club<br><br>About This Home: <br>Looking for the perfect getaway? This beautifully renovated beach cottage in the highly sought-after Phase Three of WaterColor is your ideal vacation destination! Nestled on a spacious corner lot just steps from the serene frog pond pool and park, this gorgeous home offers the ultimate blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience. With five bedrooms and five bathrooms, including a fun bunk room, this spacious retreat comfortably accommodates large families or groups. The expansive 500+ square feet of screened porches are perfect for sipping morning coffee, playing board games, or enjoying evening cocktails in the coastal breeze. The open floor plan is designed for unforgettable gatherings! Step into a welcoming sitting area that flows seamlessly into a formal dining space complete with a wet bar and built-in wine cooler. Abundant natural light illuminates the beautiful hardwood floors, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere for relaxing and socializing. <br><br>Enjoy memorable family dinners in the well-appointed kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops, white cabinetry, and a spacious island with bar seating. Just off the kitchen, the side porch invites you to dine alfresco or unwind after a fun-filled day at the beach. Explore miles of scenic trails and boardwalks on foot, by bike, or with a golf cart. Enjoy the lazy river at Camp WaterColor, upscale fitness center, golf courses, and exclusive Gulf-front dining at the private beach club. This WaterColor gem offers everything you need for an unforgettable beach vacation—luxury, space, and prime location! Don’t miss the chance to experience this beautiful home. Book now and start making memories that last a lifetime!<br><br>Floor Plan / House Layout: <br>1st Floor - Main House <br>Living Room, Dining Room, Wet Bar with Wine Cooler, Galley Style Kitchen with Natural Gas Range. Large Master Bedroom with King Bed. This bedroom has an Ensuite bathroom with a large walk in shower, dual vanity sink, and a soaking tub. Powder Room. <br>Carriage House Suite - 2nd Floor Above the Garage. Accessible from the Main House Via Stairway. <br>Full Guest Suite with a Queen Bed and a Full over Queen Bunk Bed. This bedroom has an Ensuite Bathroom with a Walk in Shower and a dual vanity sink. <br>Lounge Space - Study area just off the entrance to the Carriage House Suite. Great space for reading a book, relaxing or taking an afternoon nap. <br><br>2nd Floor - Main House <br>Guest Suite #1 with a Queen Bed and an Ensuite Bathroom with a Walk in Shower. <br>Guest Suite #2 with a Queen Bed and an Ensuite Bathroom with a Walk in Shower. <br>Bunk Room with 4 Twin Bunk beds. This bedroom shares one of the Guest Suite bathrooms. <br><br>WaterColor Community:<br>Pools: Four community pools, including the newly expanded WaterColor Beach Club and Camp WaterColor<br>Beach Club: Main pool and lounge area, infinity edge pool, zero-entry pool, Watercolor Grill, Costa Chica Restaurant, sunset bar<br>Camp WaterColor: Family pool with slide, zero-entry pool, lazy river, cabana bar, outdoor quick food restaurant<br>Other Amenities: Pay-per-play tennis center, bike and hiking trails, beach access, pedestrian-friendly sidewalks<br><br><br>Nearby Attractions:<br>Town Center: Restaurants with indoor and al fresco dining options, quaint shops, upscale dining<br>Grocery and Postal Services: Publix grocery store and US Post Office at WaterColor Crossings (half mile away)<br>Seaside: Limited parking available <br><br><br>Restrictions:<br>No Parties/Gatherings: Strictly enforced; max 12 family members allowed at a time.<br>No Pets: Sorry, no pets allowed<br>No Smoking: Non-smoking property (includes vaping and medicinal drugs)<br>Age Requirement: Minimum renter age is 25 years old to book and stay. Parents cannot rent on behalf of their children. <br>Food/Drinks: Not allowed in bedrooms or on living room furniture. <br>Vehicle Restrictions: No RVs, trailers, watercraft, or large vans permitted<br>Rental Agreement: Must be signed to avoid cancellation without refund<br>Note: Property may have date restrictions. <br><br>Good Neighbor Policy:<br>This is a family-oriented neighborhood. Excessive noise, vulgar language, large parties, and unauthorized events are strictly prohibited. Violations will result in eviction and forfeiture of all deposits.<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>All reservations submitted online are requests until you receive email confirmation from SoWal Luxury Properties. Availability of parking and rental items such as golf carts, bicycles, and beach chairs is not guaranteed. While every effort is made to ensure the listing's accuracy, some items or features may be subject to change without compensation or reimbursement.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
