        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Awesome newly remodeled home. The furniture and artwork are very beautiful and perfect for each space. Great big screened in porch off the living room, perfect play area for kiddos while the rest of the family is nearby in the living room and kitchen. Excellent response and help from property managers. Perfect location!",
